# The land is sacrificed as a cost, before the search; with no land card in the library the search finds nothing (and Crop Rotation still resolves and
# shuffles); a nonland card in the library, the Ornithopter, may not be found (the refusal). Bot1 is left with no land on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Crop Rotation
Plains x5
Ornithopter x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Crop Rotation.Cast
! Bot1.Search(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Search()
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Crop Rotation; Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
